  "content": "<h1>方塊精準：3D 物品模型</h1><p><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/126127493/553652686-449393f0-c44c-4e1a-8a99-2d12c043ebac.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NzIzOTY4NzYsIm5iZiI6MTc3MjM5NjU3NiwicGF0aCI6Ii8xMjYxMjc0OTMvNTUzNjUyNjg2LTQ0OTM5M2YwLWM0NGMtNGUxYS04YTk5LTJkMTJjMDQzZWJhYy5wbmc_.cyTq1arMl_O4fgvUhDUgJayxpnmz10yUkfSP2D0BRvw\" alt=\"\"></p><p><strong><em>為2D像素物品打造的3D模型！</em></strong></p><h2><strong>❔ 關於</strong></h2><p>「方塊精準：3D 物品模型」是一款適用於《Minecraft：Java版》的資源包，同時也支援多款模組。</p><p>其初衷是為2D像素物品添加3D模型，並讓所有獨特模型的物品保持一致風格。本資源包不會新增或修改模型與材質，可與其他資源包搭配使用。</p><h2><strong>📸 範例</strong></h2><p>以下是物品模型變更的範例說明。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04386540-6639-4dad-a839-62fbf4ff8a0b\" alt=\"\"></p><p>部分物品新增了視覺變體。</p><p><strong>🖼️ 畫作</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c4dab57-c98a-4058-9555-923ac04eb4d7\" alt=\"\"></p><p><strong>🛡️ 盔甲紋樣</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c117c9d1-f238-4711-9783-1ab627db5489\" alt=\"\"></p><h2><strong>🛠️ 安裝方式</strong></h2><p><strong>無需</strong>安裝 Optifine、CIT 等模組。</p><ol>\n<li>下載資源包</li>\n<li>將資源包放入 <code>.minecraft/resourcepack</code> 資料夾</li>\n<li>啟動 Minecraft</li>\n<li>開啟選項 → 資源包…</li>\n<li>選取並啟用 <code>Block-Accurate-v**</code></li>\n</ol><h2><strong>🧩 模組相容性</strong></h2><p>可能尚未完全支援，未來將陸續加入更多模組支援。</p><p><em>大部分的模組相容支援由 <strong>@pictochats_</strong> 提供，非常感謝！</em></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitects-palette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architect's Palette</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbiomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fboatload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boatload</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fbountiful-fares\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful Fares</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chimes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chimes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcomforts%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Comforts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreateaddition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Crafts &amp; Additions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmmmmmmmmmmmm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MmmMmmMmmMmm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dustrial-decor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">'Dustrial Decor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffarmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-weathering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Weathering</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-steam-n-rails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Steam 'n' Rails</a> <em>（尚未完成）</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frealistic-torches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Realistic Torches</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsupplementaries-squared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries Squared</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftwigs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twigs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fupgrade-aquatic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Upgrade Aquatic</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvertical-slabs-compat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vertical Slabs Compat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwilder-wild\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wilder Wild</a></li>\n</ul><h3>未來相容性計畫</h3><ul>\n<li>Blue Skies</li>\n<li>Nature's Spirit</li>\n<li>The Twilight Forest</li>\n<li>Trailier Tales</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>🌟 下載</strong></h2><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fthe-3d-item-models%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/teyokuma-3d-item-models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252f3d-item-models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/teyokuma/3D-Item-Models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></h3>",
